<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="section-padding bg-light-green">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center mb-5" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div class="section-divider"></div>
      <span class="section-tag"><i class="fas fa-circle-question"></i> FAQ</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked <span class="accent">Questions</span></h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Everything you need to know about becoming a BoviNetra delivery partner.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="row justify-content-center" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
      <div class="col-lg-8">
        <div class="accordion accordion-flush faq-accordion" id="faqPartner">
          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fp1">How do I become a delivery partner?</button></h2><div id="fp1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqPartner"><div class="accordion-body">Download the BoviNetra Partner App, complete your profile with ID verification, and submit your application. Our team reviews and approves within 24–48 hours. You can start earning the very next day.</div></div></div>
          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fp2">How are earnings calculated?</button></h2><div id="fp2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqPartner"><div class="accordion-body">Earnings are based on the number of deliveries completed per day. You'll see a clear rate per delivery before you start. Additional performance bonuses are paid for maintaining high ratings and completing all deliveries consistently.</div></div></div>
          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fp3">Do I need a vehicle?</button></h2><div id="fp3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqPartner"><div class="accordion-body">A bicycle or motorcycle is recommended for efficient delivery, but it's not mandatory if your delivery area is compact. Many partners start with a bicycle. BoviNetra does not provide vehicles.</div></div></div>
          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fp4">When do I get paid?</button></h2><div id="fp4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqPartner"><div class="accordion-body">Payments are processed weekly every Monday directly to your registered bank account or UPI. You can track your daily and weekly earnings in real time within the app.</div></div></div>
          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fp5">What if I can't deliver on a specific day?</button></h2><div id="fp5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqPartner"><div class="accordion-body">You can mark yourself as unavailable in the app at least 2 hours before your delivery window. Our system will automatically reassign deliveries to another partner. Frequent unavailability may affect your performance rating.</div></div></div>
          <div class="accordion-item"><h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fp6">Is there a registration or joining fee?</button></h2><div id="fp6" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqPartner"><div class="accordion-body">No. There is absolutely no registration fee or deposit to become a BoviNetra delivery partner. The app is free to download and use. You start earning from day one with zero upfront investment.</div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

